  <!-- EN: HAD-09 Ghoul -->
  <DNX_HAD09Ghoul_Incoming.label>HAD-09“恶鬼”</DNX_HAD09Ghoul_Incoming.label>
  <!-- EN: The HAD-09 "Ghoul" is a high-altitude unmanned bomber designed for deep strikes and critical-target destruction. It performs rapid attack runs with precision micro-missiles or a 500kg-class aerial bomb, then returns to remote airspace for resupply, maintenance, and route reprogramming. -->
  <DNX_HAD09Ghoul_Incoming.description>HAD-09“恶鬼”是一种面向纵深突袭与关键目标摧毁任务设计的高空无人轰炸机。它会使用精确微型导弹或500公斤级航空炸弹执行快速攻击航线，随后返回远端空域进行补给、检修与航线重编。</DNX_HAD09Ghoul_Incoming.description>
  
